# An allow list (complete review 2026-10-30): the image gets only what the container runs, so nothing else in this
# folder (a second config such as alt.toml with its passwords and AI key, restore leftovers, a local tool's folder,
# your data) can reach a published image. A new file or folder the image needs is added here, with a ! line.
*
!ed_outrider.py
!outrider
!resources
!static
!docker/entrypoint.sh
!requirements.txt
!requirements-overlay.txt
!ed_outrider.toml.example
!LICENSE
!README.md
# inside those, still out: ExploData's colour tables a command-line run in this checkout may have written (never
# shipped; the container downloads its own into /app/data), half-written files, caches and virtual environments
resources/bio_colours.json
resources/bio_colours.json.tmp
resources/bio_rules.json.tmp
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
